observation/cardinality assumptions, or inconsistent price sources. EXIT 
CRITERIA: Trace every PanopticPool path that reads or derives prices, identify 
the exact oracle source and time horizon, verify whether attacker-controlled 
spot movements can alter solvency, liquidation, premiums, or position values 
within one transaction or a short window, and document any exploitable impact 
with the required preconditions; conclude with no finding if all relevant paths 
use sufficiently robust, consistent manipulation-resistant pricing.

